  "description": {
    "en-US": "The Spiritual Maxims selected from the writings of St. John of the Cross, in David Lewis's English, with Zimmerman's corrections: the prologue and the maxims grouped by subject (imitation of Christ, faith, charity, prayer, obedience, poverty and so on). This is the old compilation, partly culled from his treatises, and does not follow the order of the Avisos and Dichos in Silverio's Spanish book, so it is its own book.",
